  "title": "Convert ASCII codes without rounding I64",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Convert ASCII codes without rounding I64",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The numeric overload preserves the exact I64 Array schema and order. ASCII codes 97 and 122 become 65 and 90; the unrelated exact integer 9007199254740993 remains unchanged.\n\nThe numeric overload preserves the exact I64 Array schema and order. ASCII codes 97 and 122 become 65 and 90; the unrelated exact integer 9007199254740993 remains unchanged.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.string.raw-bytes@1.\nExpected:\nresult (array<i64>) = [65,9007199254740993,90]\n",
